"Extend your operational capabilities with specialized, institutional-grade tools built around your exact business requirements.": "Elaji kapasite operasyon ou ak zouti espesyalize nivo enstitisyonèl, ki bati otou egzijans egzak biznis ou.",
"Integrated Time and Attendance": "Kontwòl lè travay entegre",
"Biometric terminals, digital timecards and geofenced mobile tracking that feed straight into payroll runs.": "Tèminal byometrik, fèy lè travay dijital ak swivi mobil ak limit jeyografik (geofencing) ki ale dirèkteman nan pewòl la.",
"Verified Pre-Employment Screening": "Verifikasyon fyab anvan anbochaj",
"Fast, compliant criminal background checks, multi-panel drug screens and automated federal E-Verify protocols.": "Verifikasyon dosye kriminèl rapid e konfòm, tès dwòg plizyè panèl ak pwotokòl federal E-Verify otomatik.",
"High-Volume Applicant Tracking": "Swivi kandida an gwo volim",
"Built for rapid recruitment and staffing organizations to source, screen, interview and onboard top candidates.": "Fèt pou òganizasyon rekritman ak ajans travay ki bezwen jwenn, evalye, fè entèvyou ak entegre pi bon kandida yo rapidman.",
"Payroll Funding and Factoring": "Finansman pewòl ak vant fakti (factoring)",
"Reliable liquidity and accounts receivable financing that keeps cash flow uninterrupted during aggressive expansion.": "Likidite ou ka konte sou li ak finansman kont pou resevwa ki kenbe lajan kach ap koule san entèripsyon pandan yon ekspansyon rapid.",
"Earned Wage Access": "Aksè ak salè ou deja touche",
"A financial wellness benefit that lets your staff access earned wages before payday, boosting retention without disrupting standard payroll.": "Yon avantaj byennèt finansye ki pèmèt anplwaye ou yo jwenn salè yo deja touche anvan jou peman, sa ki ede kenbe yo san li pa deranje pewòl nòmal la.",
"LMS and Performance Enablement": "LMS ak devlopman pèfòmans",
"Digital learning libraries for safety, compliance and leadership training, with structured performance reviews and goal tracking.": "Bibliyotèk aprantisaj dijital pou fòmasyon sou sekirite, konfòmite ak lidèchip, ak evalyasyon pèfòmans estriktire ak swivi objektif.",
"Client Success": "Siksè kliyan",
"Results Our Clients Talk About": "Rezilta kliyan nou yo pale de yo",
"Featured client quote on what changed after partnering with Key HR.": "Temwayaj yon kliyan sou sa ki chanje apre li fin fè patenarya ak Key HR.",
"Client name": "Non kliyan",
