"Your current benefits renewal": "Renouvèlman avantaj ou genyen kounye a",
"Don’t have everything? Start anyway. We’ll help you gather the rest.": "Ou pa gen tout bagay? Kòmanse kanmenm. N ap ede ou jwenn rès la.",
"Questions Owners Ask About PEOs": "Kesyon pwopriyetè biznis poze sou PEO",
"Straight answers before you ever talk to us.": "Repons dirèk, menm anvan ou pale ak nou.",
"Still unsure? Ask the assistant or call": "Ou toujou gen dout? Mande asistan an oswa rele",
"What is a PEO? Learn how it works": "Kisa yon PEO ye? Aprann kijan li mache",
"A professional employer organization takes on payroll and payroll taxes, HR administration, compliance, workers’ comp and benefits for your business through co-employment. You keep running your team. Key HR handles the paperwork and compliance behind it.": "Yon òganizasyon patwon pwofesyonèl (PEO) pran chaj pewòl ak taks sou pewòl, administrasyon RH, konfòmite, asirans aksidan travay ak avantaj pou biznis ou atravè ko-anplwa. Ou kontinye dirije ekip ou. Key HR okipe papye ak konfòmite ki dèyè sa.",
"Will I lose control of my business or my employees?": "Èske m ap pèdi kontwòl biznis mwen oswa anplwaye mwen yo?",
"No. You still hire, manage, schedule and set pay, and every business decision stays yours. Key HR becomes the employer of record only for payroll, taxes, workers’ comp and benefits.": "Non. Ou toujou anboche, jere, fè orè epi fikse salè, e chak desizyon biznis rete pou ou. Key HR vin patwon ofisyèl (employer of record) sèlman pou pewòl, taks, asirans aksidan travay ak avantaj.",
"How is a PEO different from a payroll company?": "Ki diferans ki genyen ant yon PEO ak yon konpayi pewòl?",
"A payroll company runs payroll. A PEO also brings HR support, compliance, workers’ comp and benefits under one service, and shares the employer responsibilities with you.": "Yon konpayi pewòl fè pewòl. Yon PEO bay tou sipò RH, konfòmite, asirans aksidan travay ak avantaj nan yon sèl sèvis, epi li pataje responsablite patwon yo avè ou.",
"How does workers’ comp work through Key HR?": "Kijan asirans aksidan travay mache avèk Key HR?",
"Coverage is built into your service, and premiums are paid as you go with each payroll, so there’s no large deposit up front. Higher-risk classes may be placed through our in-house insurance agency.": "Kouvèti a enkli nan sèvis ou, epi ou peye prim yo ak chak pewòl, kidonk pa gen gwo depo pou bay davans. Klas ki gen plis risk ka plase atravè ajans asirans entèn nou an.",
"Why does ESAC accreditation matter?": "Poukisa akreditasyon ESAC enpòtan?",
"ESAC independently checks that a PEO is financially sound and that payroll taxes, benefits and workers’ comp premiums are actually paid. It’s one of the strongest assurances a PEO can offer.": "ESAC verifye de fason endepandan si yon PEO solid finansyèman e si taks sou pewòl, avantaj ak prim asirans aksidan travay yo peye toutbon. Se youn nan pi gwo garanti yon PEO ka ofri.",
"Our Sales Team": "Ekip lavant nou an",
