"Careers With Key HR": "Karyè nan Key HR",
"Unlock Career Opportunities with Key HR": "Dekouvri opòtinite karyè ak Key HR",
"Join a team of professionals who believe great service is built by great people. At Key HR, your work directly shapes how businesses across the country grow.": "Antre nan yon ekip pwofesyonèl ki kwè ke bon sèvis se bon moun ki bati l. Nan Key HR, travay ou gen yon enpak dirèk sou fason biznis atravè peyi a ap grandi.",
"Apply now": "Aplike kounye a",
"Explore our teams": "Dekouvri ekip nou yo",
"A Team Worth Joining": "Yon ekip ki vo lapenn ou antre ladan",
"Now Hiring Talent Producers": "N ap anboche pwodiktè ki gen talan",
"People first, always": "Moun yo an premye, toujou",
"Competitive compensation": "Reminerasyon konpetitif",
"Robust benefits packages": "Pakèt avantaj solid",
"Professional growth opportunities": "Opòtinite pou grandi nan karyè",
"Exciting bonus incentives": "Bonis ak ankourajman enteresan",
"Life at Key HR": "Lavi nan Key HR",
"Where People Come First": "Kote moun yo pase an premye",
"The same values that guide how we serve clients shape how we work together.": "Menm valè ki gide fason nou sèvi kliyan yo detèmine fason nou travay ansanm.",
"We are in the business of upgrading human capital, and we start by investing in our own. At Key HR, you won’t get lost in corporate red tape, you’ll join a collaborative, high-energy team of Subject Matter Experts where your voice is heard, your expertise is valued, and your impact is felt every day.": "Travay nou se amelyore kapital imen, e nou kòmanse pa envesti nan pa nou. Nan Key HR, ou p ap pèdi nan biwokrasi konpayi, w ap antre nan yon ekip ekspè ki kolabore e ki gen anpil enèji, kote yo tande vwa ou, yo valorize ekspètiz ou, e enpak ou santi chak jou.",
"Empowerment & Ownership": "Otonomi ak responsablite",
"We trust our people to do what they do best, giving you the autonomy and resources to solve real challenges for businesses nationwide.": "Nou fè moun nou yo konfyans pou yo fè sa yo konn fè pi byen, nou ba ou otonomi ak resous pou rezoud vrè defi pou biznis atravè peyi a.",
"Growth on a Fast Track": "Kwasans rapid",
"As a three-time Inc. 5,000 honoree, our rapid national expansion creates continuous opportunities to advance your career and sharpen your skills.": "Kòm yon konpayi ki onore twa fwa nan lis Inc. 5,000, ekspansyon rapid nou atravè peyi a kreye opòtinite toutan pou ou avanse nan karyè ou epi amelyore konpetans ou.",
"True Collaboration": "Vrè kolaborasyon",
"From leadership to operations, we work side‑by‑side with open doors, transparent communication, and shared goals.": "Soti nan direksyon rive nan operasyon, nou travay kòt a kòt, ak pòt louvri, kominikasyon transparan ak objektif nou pataje.",
"Work-Life Harmony": "Ekilib ant travay ak lavi pèsonèl",
"We support the whole person with comprehensive benefits, competitive compensation, and a culture that respects your life outside the office.": "Nou sipòte tout moun nan antye avèk avantaj konplè, reminerasyon konpetitif ak yon kilti ki respekte lavi ou andeyò biwo a.",
"Our Teams": "Ekip nou yo",
"Find Where You Fit": "Jwenn plas ou",
"We hire across six areas. Choose the one that matches your experience when you apply.": "Nou anboche nan sis domèn. Lè w ap aplike, chwazi sa ki koresponn ak eksperyans ou.",
"Sales": "Lavant",
"Build relationships with business owners and referral partners, and help them find the right workforce solution.": "Bati relasyon ak pwopriyetè biznis ak patnè referans, epi ede yo jwenn bon solisyon pou fòs travay yo.",
"Process accurate, on-time payroll and tax filings for clients across the country.": "Trete pewòl ak deklarasyon taks kliyan atravè peyi a avèk presizyon e alè.",
"Be the dedicated point of contact who keeps clients supported every day.": "Se ou ki pral moun kontak dedye ki bay kliyan yo sipò chak jou.",
"Guide clients and employees through plans, enrollment and renewals.": "Gide kliyan ak anplwaye yo nan plan yo, enskripsyon ak renouvèlman.",
"PEO": "PEO",
"PEO Operations": "Operasyon PEO",
"Support the compliance, risk and operations work that powers the PEO model.": "Sipòte travay konfòmite, risk ak operasyon ki fè modèl PEO a mache.",
"Support Staff": "Pèsonèl sipò",
"Keep our office, systems and teams running smoothly behind the scenes.": "Kenbe biwo nou, sistèm nou ak ekip nou yo ap mache byen dèyè rido a.",
"Open positions": "Pòs ki disponib",
"Specific openings will be listed here. In the meantime, send us your information and resume and our team will reach out when there’s a fit.": "N ap pibliye pòs espesifik yo isit la. Pandan tan sa a, voye enfòmasyon ou ak CV ou ba nou, e ekip nou an ap kontakte ou lè gen yon pòs ki koresponn.",
"open positions list": "lis pòs ki disponib",
