"Choose the Right Login": "Chwazi bon koneksyon an",
"Each portal opens in a new tab. Not sure which one you need? Your Key HR team is a call away.": "Chak pòtay louvri nan yon nouvo onglè. Ou pa sèten kilès ou bezwen? Ekip Key HR ou a se yon apèl telefòn sèlman.",
"Run payroll, approve time off, manage employees and pull reports.": "Fè pewòl, apwouve konje, jere anplwaye epi jenere rapò.",
