"About Us | Key HR": "Sou nou | Key HR",
"Pick a day and time that work for you, and a Key HR advisor will call to talk through your business. No pressure, just answers.": "Chwazi yon jou ak yon lè ki bon pou ou, epi yon konseye Key HR ap rele w pou nou pale sou biznis ou. Pa gen presyon, se repons sèlman.",
"Your call is with an experienced advisor, not a call center. Expect a conversation about your payroll, HR, compliance, risk and benefits goals, and clear next steps if it’s a fit.": "Apèl ou a se ak yon konseye ki gen eksperyans, pa yon sant apèl. Atann ou a yon konvèsasyon sou objektif ou pou pewòl, RH, konfòmite, risk ak avantaj, ak pwochen etap ki klè si sa bon pou ou.",
"Schedule my call": "Pwograme apèl mwen",
"Call Requested": "Demann apèl resevwa",
"Schedule a Call": "Pwograme yon apèl",
"In the live site, a Key HR advisor would confirm your call time by email within": "Sou sit reyèl la, yon konseye Key HR ta konfime lè apèl ou a pa imèl nan",
"A PEO can likely take these off your plate. A short conversation will confirm it.": "Yon PEO ka pwobableman retire travay sa yo sou do w. Yon ti konvèsasyon ap konfime sa.",
"Your business is a strong candidate for a PEO. Let’s build your custom plan.": "Biznis ou se yon bon kandida pou yon PEO. Ann bati plan pèsonalize ou.",
"Thanks for your question. This is a preview of the Key HR assistant. At launch it will answer questions like this one and connect you with a person any time.": "Mèsi pou kesyon ou. Sa a se yon apèsi asistan Key HR la. Lè l lanse, l ap reponn kesyon tankou sa a epi konekte w ak yon moun nenpòt ki lè.",
"Medical, dental, vision, hospital indemnity, accident, critical illness, disability, FSA, HSA, 401(k), legal and pet coverage, with full benefits administration and ACA reporting.": "Asirans medikal, dantè, vizyon, endamnite lopital, aksidan, maladi grav, andikap, FSA, HSA, 401(k), legal ak pou bèt kay, ak administrasyon konplè avantaj yo ak rapò ACA.",
