"Purpose and Intellectual Property": "Objektif ak pwopriyete entelektyèl",
"This website provides information regarding the Professional Employer Organization (PEO), payroll, employee benefits, risk management, and human resource solutions offered by Key HR. All content, graphics, tools, and materials on this website are the exclusive property of Key HR. Nothing on this website constitutes legal, tax, or compliance advice, nor does it represent a binding contractual offer for services or employment. All materials are provided without warranties of any kind, either express or implied.": "Sit entènèt sa a bay enfòmasyon sou solisyon Òganizasyon Patwon Pwofesyonèl (PEO), pewòl, avantaj pou anplwaye, jesyon risk ak Resous Imen Key HR ofri. Tout kontni, grafik, zouti ak materyèl ki sou sit entènèt sa a se pwopriyete eksklizif Key HR. Anyen sou sit entènèt sa a pa konstitye yon konsèy legal, fiskal oswa sou konfòmite, ni li pa reprezante yon òf kontraktyèl ki angaje pou sèvis oswa pou travay. Tout materyèl yo bay san okenn garanti, kit li eksprime kit li enplisit.",
"Information Accuracy and Business Communications": "Presizyon enfòmasyon ak kominikasyon biznis",
"While Key HR is committed to providing accurate and up-to-date resources, we reserve the right to modify website content at any time without notice and assume no liability for errors or omissions. By submitting contact details or business information through our website forms, calculators, or submission portals, Users (defined as any individual or entity accessing this site) authorize Key HR to use such information for legitimate business purposes, including follow-up communications via email, telephone, or text message. We do not sell your personal contact information to third-party marketers. Key HR reserves the right to revoke or restrict access to this website at any time.": "Byenke Key HR angaje l pou bay resous ki egzak e ki ajou, nou rezève dwa pou nou modifye kontni sit entènèt la nenpòt ki lè san avètisman, epi nou pa pran okenn responsablite pou erè oswa omisyon. Lè yo soumèt enfòmasyon kontak oswa enfòmasyon biznis atravè fòmilè, kalkilatris oswa pòtay soumisyon sit entènèt nou an, Itilizatè yo (sa vle di nenpòt moun oswa antite ki gen aksè a sit sa a) otorize Key HR pou itilize enfòmasyon sa yo pou rezon biznis lejitim, tankou kominikasyon swivi pa imèl, telefòn oswa mesaj tèks. Nou pa vann enfòmasyon kontak pèsonèl ou bay konpayi maketing deyò. Key HR rezève dwa pou anile oswa limite aksè a sit entènèt sa a nenpòt ki lè.",
"Third-Party Links and Authorized Use": "Lyen lòt konpayi ak itilizasyon otorize",
"For your convenience, this website may link to external resources or secure service portals. Key HR does not control or endorse unaffiliated third-party websites and is not responsible for their content, privacy practices, or availability. Users access external links at their own risk. Any unauthorized framing, automated data scraping, or deceptive linking to this website is strictly prohibited without prior written consent from an authorized Key HR representative.": "Pou fasilite w, sit entènèt sa a ka gen lyen ki mennen nan resous deyò oswa nan pòtay sèvis ki an sekirite. Key HR pa kontwole ni li pa apiye sit entènèt lòt konpayi ki pa afilye avè l, epi li pa responsab kontni yo, pratik konfidansyalite yo oswa disponiblite yo. Itilizatè yo itilize lyen deyò sa yo sou pwòp risk yo. Li entèdi nèt pou mete sit entènèt sa a nan yon ankadreman san otorizasyon, pou ekstrè done ladan l otomatikman oswa pou kreye lyen twonpè ki mennen sou li, san konsantman alekri davans yon reprezantan otorize Key HR.",
"Limitation of Liability and Indemnification": "Limit responsablite ak endamnizasyon",
"Key HR is not liable for any technical malfunctions, service interruptions, or system errors affecting this website. By accessing or interacting with this website, you agree to indemnify and hold harmless Key HR, its executives, employees, and affiliates from any claims, damages, liabilities, demands, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys’ fees) arising out of your use of this website or violation of these terms.": "Key HR pa responsab okenn pann teknik, entèripsyon sèvis oswa erè sistèm ki afekte sit entènèt sa a. Lè ou gen aksè oswa ou itilize sit entènèt sa a, ou dakò pou endamnize epi pwoteje Key HR, egzekitif li yo, anplwaye li yo ak afilye li yo kont nenpòt reklamasyon, domaj, responsablite, demann ak depans (tankou frè avoka rezonab) ki soti nan fason ou itilize sit entènèt sa a oswa nan vyolasyon kondisyon sa yo.",
