"Use a personal email address, not a work email. You will need it to receive verification codes and password resets.": "Sèvi ak yon adrès imèl pèsonèl, pa imèl travay ou. W ap bezwen l pou resevwa kòd verifikasyon ak pou chanje modpas ou.",
