"Select Taxes": "Chwazi Taxes",
"In the menu on the left side of the screen, select Taxes.": "Nan meni ki sou bò gòch ekran an, chwazi Taxes (taks).",
"View or Download Your W-2": "Gade oswa telechaje W-2 ou",
"Choose the tax year to view current and past W-2s and other tax documents. You can print or save a copy for your records.": "Chwazi ane fiskal la pou w wè W-2 ane sa a ak ane pase yo ansanm ak lòt dokiman taks. Ou ka enprime oswa sove yon kopi pou dosye ou.",
"Tip:": "Konsèy:",
"Your registration details must match your employee record. If the portal does not recognize your information, contact Key HR and we will help you get access.": "Enfòmasyon enskripsyon ou dwe koresponn ak dosye anplwaye ou. Si pòtay la pa rekonèt enfòmasyon ou, kontakte Key HR epi n ap ede w jwenn aksè.",
