"HR & Client Services": "RH ak sèvis kliyan",
"Women‑owned": "Konpayi fanm posede",
"At the helm of Key HR is a seasoned executive team of PEO and HR veterans who believe great leadership starts with accessibility. With decades of combined experience across nationwide payroll, employee benefits, risk management, and strategic growth, our leaders don’t manage from a distance, they remain actively engaged with our clients, our referral partners, and our internal Subject Matter Experts.": "Nan tèt Key HR, gen yon ekip egzekitif ki gen anpil eksperyans nan PEO ak RH, ki kwè bon lidèchip kòmanse ak aksesiblite. Avèk plizyè dizèn ane eksperyans ansanm nan pewòl atravè tout peyi a, avantaj pou anplwaye, jesyon risk ak kwasans estratejik, lidè nou yo pa dirije a distans, yo rete angaje aktivman ak kliyan nou yo, patnè referans nou yo ak ekspè entèn nou yo.",
"By blending forward-thinking strategy with a hands-on commitment to transparency and operational rigor, the Key HR leadership team ensures every client receives the high-touch support, financial security, and innovative solutions needed to thrive.": "Lè yo mete ansanm yon estrateji ki gade lwen ak yon angajman konkrè pou transparans ak rigè nan operasyon, ekip lidèchip Key HR asire chak kliyan resevwa sipò pèsonèl, sekirite finansye ak solisyon inovatè li bezwen pou l pwospere.",
"Director of Broker Channels": "Direktè kanal koutye",
"Our Story": "Istwa nou",
"Our story details coming soon": "Detay sou istwa nou ap vini byento",
"Key HR team delivering holiday gifts to a pediatric hospital": "Ekip Key HR k ap pote kado fèt nan yon lopital pedyatrik",
"Key HR team members handing holiday gifts to children": "Manm ekip Key HR k ap bay timoun kado fèt",
"Key HR team volunteering at a food pantry": "Ekip Key HR k ap fè volontarya nan yon depo manje",
"Key HR was established with a clear mission: to rescue business owners from the limitations and challenges of traditional outsourcing. We set out to build a true single-source PEO that treats every client’s business like our own, surrounding leadership teams with strategic workforce management infrastructure that delivers more flexibility, support and personalization.": "Key HR te fonde ak yon misyon klè: delivre pwopriyetè biznis yo anba limit ak defi sous-trètans tradisyonèl la. Nou te pran desizyon pou bati yon vrè PEO ki bay tout sèvis nan yon sèl kote, ki trete biznis chak kliyan tankou pa nou, epi ki antoure ekip lidèchip yo ak yon enfrastrikti estratejik pou jesyon fòs travay ki bay plis fleksibilite, sipò ak pèsonalizasyon.",
"What began with a commitment to real transparency and white-glove service has grown into an ESAC-accredited, three-time Inc. 5000 nationwide partner serving businesses across all 50 states and Puerto Rico. Today, our dedicated Subject Matter Experts and unified HCM technology work side-by-side with employers every day, lifting the operational weight off their shoulders so they can reclaim their freedom, empower their people, and scale with unstoppable confidence.": "Sa ki te kòmanse ak yon angajman pou vrè transparans ak sèvis premye klas vin tounen yon patnè nasyonal akredite pa ESAC, ki parèt twa fwa nan lis Inc. 5000, epi ki sèvi biznis nan tout 50 eta yo ak Pòtoriko. Jodi a, ekspè dedye nou yo ak teknoloji HCM inifye nou an travay kòt a kòt ak patwon yo chak jou, pou retire chay operasyon an sou zepòl yo pou yo ka reprann libète yo, bay moun yo plis pouvwa epi grandi ak yon konfyans ki pa ka kanpe.",
"Key HR was established with a clear mission: to rescue business owners from the limitations and challenges of traditional outsourcing.": "Key HR te fonde ak yon misyon klè: delivre pwopriyetè biznis yo anba limit ak defi sous-trètans tradisyonèl la.",
"We set out to build a true single-source PEO that treats every client’s business like our own, surrounding leadership teams with strategic workforce management infrastructure that delivers more flexibility, support and personalization.": "Nou te pran desizyon pou bati yon vrè PEO ki bay tout sèvis nan yon sèl kote, ki trete biznis chak kliyan tankou pa nou, epi ki antoure ekip lidèchip yo ak yon enfrastrikti estratejik pou jesyon fòs travay ki bay plis fleksibilite, sipò ak pèsonalizasyon.",
