"Download the forms you need for new hires, payroll changes, workers’ compensation and workplace postings. Key HR forms are fillable PDFs that open in a new window, ready to complete, save and print.": "Telechaje fòm ou bezwen pou nouvo anplwaye, chanjman pewòl, asirans aksidan travay (workers' comp) ak afich nan plas travay. Fòm Key HR yo se PDF ou ka ranpli ki louvri nan yon nouvo fenèt, pare pou ranpli, anrejistre epi enprime.",
