"/ Compliance": "/ Konfòmite",
"Compliance Handled at Every Level": "Konfòmite jere nan tout nivo",
"Federal. State. Local. One Accountable Partner.": "Federal. Eta. Lokal. Yon sèl patnè ki responsab.",
"Every employee you add brings new tax accounts, filings, postings and employment rules to keep up with. As your PEO, Key HR takes on a defined share of those obligations and gives you expert guidance on the rest, so compliance stops being a hidden risk and becomes a process you can count on.": "Chak anplwaye ou ajoute pote nouvo kont taks, deklarasyon, afich ak règ travay pou swiv. Kòm PEO ou, Key HR pran yon pati defini nan obligasyon sa yo epi ba ou konsèy ekspè sou rès la, konsa konfòmite sispann yon risk kache epi li vin tounen yon pwosesis ou ka konte sou li.",
"Your Compliance, Fully Supported": "Konfòmite ou, ak sipò konplè",
"Federal payroll tax deposits and filings": "Depo ak deklarasyon taks pewòl federal",
"State registrations in all 50 states and Puerto Rico": "Anrejistreman nan eta yo nan tout 50 eta yo ak Pòtoriko",
"FLSA classification guidance": "Konsèy sou klasifikasyon FLSA",
"ACA reporting on Forms 1094-C and 1095-C": "Rapò ACA sou Fòm 1094-C ak 1095-C",
"COBRA administration": "Administrasyon COBRA",
"EEO-1 reporting support": "Sipò pou rapò EEO-1",
"How PEO Compliance Works": "Kijan konfòmite ak yon PEO mache",
"The Four Pillars of PEO Compliance": "Kat pilye konfòmite ak yon PEO",
"Employer compliance is not one obligation. It is a set of overlapping federal, state and local requirements that grow every time you hire in a new place or add a new benefit.": "Konfòmite pou yon patwon se pa yon sèl obligasyon. Se yon seri egzijans federal, eta ak lokal ki kwaze youn ak lòt e ki ogmante chak fwa ou anboche nan yon nouvo kote oswa ou ajoute yon nouvo avantaj.",
"Through co-employment, Key HR takes on specific responsibilities in each of these areas and supports you on the ones that remain with your business.": "Atravè ko-anplwa, Key HR pran responsablite espesifik nan chak domèn sa yo epi li sipòte ou nan sa ki rete sou kont biznis ou.",
"Federal Payroll Taxes": "Taks pewòl federal",
"Accurately withholding, depositing and reporting federal income tax, Social Security, Medicare and federal unemployment tax for every employee, on every deadline.": "Retni, depoze epi deklare egzakteman taks federal sou revni, Social Security, Medicare ak taks federal chomaj pou chak anplwaye, nan chak dat limit.",
"State Registration and Reporting": "Anrejistreman ak rapò nan eta yo",
"Setting up and maintaining state unemployment insurance and income tax withholding accounts in every state where your people work, then filing on each state’s schedule.": "Louvri epi kenbe kont asirans chomaj eta ak kont retni taks sou revni nan chak eta kote moun ou yo travay, epi depoze dapre orè chak eta.",
"Employment Law": "Lwa travay",
"Wage and hour, anti-discrimination, leave and workplace safety rules apply to your business no matter who runs payroll. We help you follow them with confidence.": "Règ sou salè ak lè travay, kont diskriminasyon, konje ak sekirite nan travay aplike pou biznis ou kèlkeswa moun ki fè pewòl la. Nou ede ou swiv yo avèk konfyans.",
"Insurance and Benefits": "Asirans ak avantaj",
"Workers’ compensation coverage, Affordable Care Act employer requirements and ERISA rules for health and retirement plans, administered and reported correctly.": "Kouvèti asirans aksidan travay (workers' comp), egzijans Lwa sou swen sante abòdab (ACA) pou patwon ak règ ERISA pou plan sante ak plan retrèt, administre epi rapòte kòrèkteman.",
"Shared Responsibility": "Responsablite pataje",
"A PEO relationship works best when everyone knows their role. Here is how compliance responsibilities are typically divided between Key HR and your business.": "Yon relasyon ak yon PEO mache pi byen lè chak moun konnen wòl yo. Men kijan responsablite konfòmite yo divize anjeneral ant Key HR ak biznis ou.",
"Area": "Domèn",
