"Key HR typically manages": "Sa Key HR jere anjeneral",
"Your business stays responsible for": "Sa ki rete sou responsablite biznis ou",
"Your business": "Biznis ou",
"Federal employment taxes": "Taks federal sou anplwa",
"Depositing and filing Social Security, Medicare, federal unemployment and federal income tax withholding for wages paid through Key HR.": "Depoze epi deklare Social Security, Medicare, chomaj federal ak retni taks federal sou revni pou salè ki peye atravè Key HR.",
"Submitting accurate, timely hours and pay data and approving each payroll.": "Voye done sou lè travay ak peman ki egzak e alè, epi apwouve chak pewòl.",
"State and local payroll taxes": "Taks pewòl eta ak lokal",
"Registering, withholding and filing state and local payroll taxes where your employees work. Account structure varies by state.": "Anrejistre, retni epi deklare taks pewòl eta ak lokal kote anplwaye ou yo travay. Estrikti kont yo chanje selon eta a.",
"Telling us before you hire in a new state, city or work location.": "Fè nou konnen anvan ou anboche nan yon nouvo eta, yon nouvo vil oswa yon nouvo kote travay.",
"Holding the master policy, issuing certificates and managing claims from first report to return to work.": "Kenbe polis mèt la, bay sètifika epi jere reklamasyon yo depi premye rapò a jiska retou nan travay.",
"Keeping a safe workplace and reporting every injury within 24 hours.": "Kenbe yon plas travay ki an sekirite epi rapòte chak blesi nan 24 èdtan.",
"Benefits, ERISA and ACA": "Avantaj, ERISA ak ACA",
"Administering the Key HR master benefit plans, meeting fiduciary duties for those plans and filing ACA Forms 1094-C and 1095-C.": "Administre plan avantaj mèt Key HR yo, akonpli devwa fidisyè pou plan sa yo epi depoze Fòm ACA 1094-C ak 1095-C.",
"Sharing eligibility and hours information and offering coverage under the plans you select.": "Pataje enfòmasyon sou kalifikasyon ak lè travay, epi ofri kouvèti dapre plan ou chwazi yo.",
"Employment practices": "Pratik travay",
"Employment practices liability coverage where included in your agreement, plus guidance and support if a claim arises.": "Kouvèti responsablite pou pratik travay lè li enkli nan kontra ou, plis konsèy ak sipò si gen yon reklamasyon.",
"Following documented policies and involving Key HR before discipline or terminations.": "Swiv politik ki dokimante epi enplike Key HR anvan mezi disiplinè oswa revokasyon.",
"HR compliance functions": "Fonksyon konfòmite RH",
"COBRA administration, EEO-1 support, FLSA classification guidance and the other functions listed in your client service agreement.": "Administrasyon COBRA, sipò pou EEO-1, konsèy sou klasifikasyon FLSA ak lòt fonksyon ki nan kontra sèvis kliyan ou.",
"Daily supervision, hiring decisions, scheduling and workplace conduct.": "Sipèvizyon chak jou, desizyon anbochaj, orè ak konduit nan plas travay.",
"Exact responsibilities are defined in your client service agreement, and some vary by state. Your Key HR team will walk you through every item before you sign.": "Responsablite egzak yo defini nan kontra sèvis kliyan ou, e kèk ladan yo chanje selon eta a. Ekip Key HR ou ap revize chak pwen avèk ou anvan ou siyen.",
"Where We Add the Most Value": "Kote nou pote plis valè",
"Expert Support for the Rules That Trip Up Growing Employers": "Sipò ekspè pou règ ki pi souvan bay patwon k ap grandi pwoblèm",
"Multi-State Employment Law": "Lwa travay nan plizyè eta",
"Each new state brings its own minimum wage, final pay, leave and posting rules. We flag them before your first hire there.": "Chak nouvo eta gen pwòp règ li sou salè minimòm, dènye peman, konje ak afich. Nou siyale yo ba ou anvan premye anbochaj ou la.",
"FLSA Classification": "Klasifikasyon FLSA",
"Guidance on exempt and non-exempt status and on employees versus contractors, two of the most common sources of wage claims.": "Konsèy sou estati egzante ak non-egzante ak sou diferans ant anplwaye ak kontraktè, de nan sous ki pi komen pou reklamasyon sou salè.",
"Paid Leave Administration": "Administrasyon konje peye",
"Federal FMLA and the growing list of state and local paid sick and family leave laws, tracked and applied correctly.": "Lwa federal FMLA ak lis lwa eta ak lokal sou konje maladi ak konje fanmi peye k ap grandi, swiv epi aplike kòrèkteman.",
"Wage and Hour": "Salè ak lè travay",
"Overtime, meal and rest breaks, regular rate calculations and final paycheck timing handled the way each state requires.": "Lè siplemantè, poz pou manje ak repo, kalkil to regilye ak delè pou dènye chèk pewòl la, jere jan chak eta egzije l.",
"ACA and EEO Reporting": "Rapò ACA ak EEO",
"Affordable Care Act reporting for applicable large employers and support preparing EEO-1 workforce data.": "Rapò Lwa sou swen sante abòdab (ACA) pou gwo patwon ki konsène ak sipò pou prepare done anplwaye pou EEO-1.",
"Workplace Safety and Training": "Sekirite nan travay ak fòmasyon",
"OSHA recordkeeping, required labor law postings and state-mandated training such as harassment prevention, tracked for you.": "Dosye OSHA, afich lwa travay obligatwa ak fòmasyon eta egzije tankou prevansyon arasman, swiv pou ou.",
"Reporting Calendar": "Kalandriye rapò",
"The Filings That Keep Your Business in Good Standing": "Deklarasyon ki kenbe biznis ou an règ",
"These recurring federal and state filings apply to most employers. Here is where each one stands when you partner with Key HR.": "Deklarasyon federal ak eta sa yo ki repete chak peryòd aplike pou pifò patwon. Men kote chak rete lè ou fè patenarya ak Key HR.",
