"Forms 1099-NEC": "Fòm 1099-NEC",
"Required for independent contractors your business pays directly.": "Obligatwa pou kontraktè endepandan biznis ou peye dirèkteman.",
"Supported by Key HR": "Avèk sipò Key HR",
