"ACA Forms 1094-C and 1095-C": "Fòm 1094-C ak 1095-C ACA",
"Coverage reporting for applicable large employers and their full-time employees.": "Rapò sou kouvèti pou gwo patwon ki konsène yo ak anplwaye a tan plen yo.",
