"Annual summary of work-related injuries, posted at covered worksites.": "Rezime anyèl blesi ki gen rapò ak travay, ki afiche nan sit travay ki konsène yo.",
"Annually": "Chak ane",
"EEO-1 Component 1": "EEO-1 Konpozan 1",
"Workforce demographic report for employers with 100 or more employees and certain federal contractors.": "Rapò demografik sou mendèv la pou patwon ki gen 100 anplwaye oswa plis ak kèk kontraktè federal.",
"July 31": "31 jiyè",
"Form 5500": "Fòm 5500",
"Annual benefit plan report, due for calendar-year plans on the last day of the seventh month after plan year end.": "Rapò anyèl sou plan avantaj, ki dwe depoze pou plan ki swiv ane kalandriye a dènye jou setyèm mwa apre fen ane plan an.",
"Clear Expectations": "Atant ki klè",
"What Stays With Your Own Advisors": "Sa ki rete nan men pwòp konseye ou yo",
"A PEO strengthens your compliance program, but it does not replace every professional your business relies on. We are upfront about where our role ends, so nothing falls through the cracks.": "Yon PEO ranfòse pwogram konfòmite ou, men li pa ranplase chak pwofesyonèl biznis ou konte sou yo. Nou di ou klèman ki kote wòl nou fini, konsa pa gen anyen ki chape.",
"Legal advice and representation": "Konsèy legal ak reprezantasyon",
"We provide HR guidance. Your attorney advises on legal strategy and represents you in disputes.": "Nou bay konsèy sou RH. Avoka ou konseye ou sou estrateji legal epi li reprezante ou nan konfli yo.",
"Business tax planning": "Planifikasyon taks biznis",
"We manage payroll taxes. Your CPA handles income tax, entity structure and tax planning.": "Nou jere taks pewòl yo. CPA ou okipe taks sou revni, estrikti antite a ak planifikasyon taks.",
"Other business insurance": "Lòt asirans biznis",
"Property, general liability, auto and professional coverage stay with your insurance agent.": "Kouvèti pou pwopriyete, responsablite sivil jeneral, machin ak responsablite pwofesyonèl rete avèk ajan asirans ou.",
"Industry licensing": "Lisans endistri",
"Professional and business licenses specific to your industry remain your responsibility.": "Lisans pwofesyonèl ak lisans biznis ki espesifik pou endistri ou rete responsablite ou.",
"Day-to-day operations": "Operasyon chak jou",
"You keep full control of how you run your business, manage your team and serve your customers.": "Ou kenbe tout kontwòl sou fason ou mennen biznis ou, jere ekip ou epi sèvi kliyan ou yo.",
"Compliance Questions": "Kesyon sou konfòmite",
"What does PEO compliance actually cover?": "Kisa konfòmite PEO kouvri vrèman?",
"It spans four areas: federal payroll taxes, state tax registration and reporting, employment law and insurance and benefits requirements. Key HR takes on specific duties in each area and supports you on the rest, as outlined in your client service agreement.": "Li kouvri kat domèn: taks pewòl federal, enskripsyon ak rapò taks eta, lwa travay, ak egzijans asirans ak avantaj. Key HR pran responsablite espesifik nan chak domèn epi li ba ou sipò pou rès la, jan akò sèvis kliyan ou an endike sa.",
"Does a PEO take on all of my compliance responsibility?": "Èske yon PEO pran tout responsablite konfòmite mwen an chaj?",
"No. A PEO shares employer responsibilities with you through co-employment. Key HR manages areas such as payroll tax filings, workers’ compensation and benefits administration, while your business remains responsible for daily supervision, workplace conduct and the decisions you make as an employer.": "Non. Yon PEO pataje responsablite patwon yo avè ou atravè ko-anplwa. Key HR jere domèn tankou deklarasyon taks pewòl, asirans aksidan travay (workers’ comp) ak administrasyon avantaj yo, pandan biznis ou rete responsab sipèvizyon chak jou, konduit nan travay la ak desizyon ou pran antanke patwon.",
"What is a Certified PEO (CPEO)?": "Kisa yon PEO sètifye (CPEO) ye?",
"The IRS Certified Professional Employer Organization program allows qualifying PEOs to assume sole liability for federal employment taxes on the wages they pay to worksite employees. Key HR is ESAC accredited, an independent standard for financial strength and ethical practices. Your Key HR team can explain exactly how federal tax responsibility is handled under your agreement.": "Pwogram Certified Professional Employer Organization IRS la pèmèt PEO ki kalifye yo pran responsablite eksklizif pou taks federal sou travay sou salè yo peye anplwaye sit travay yo. Key HR gen akreditasyon ESAC, yon estanda endepandan pou solidite finansye ak pratik etik. Ekip Key HR ou a ka eksplike ou egzakteman kijan responsablite taks federal la jere dapre akò ou.",
"What happens when I hire in a new state?": "Kisa k ap pase lè mwen anboche nan yon nouvo eta?",
"Let us know before the employee starts. Key HR sets up the required state tax accounts, confirms workers’ compensation coverage and flags the state’s wage, leave and posting requirements so you are compliant from day one.": "Fè nou konnen anvan anplwaye a kòmanse. Key HR louvri kont taks eta obligatwa yo, li konfime kouvèti asirans aksidan travay la epi li siyale egzijans eta a sou salè, konje ak afichaj, konsa ou an konfòmite depi premye jou a.",
"Who files ACA reporting for my employees?": "Kiyès ki depoze rapò ACA pou anplwaye mwen yo?",
"For employees enrolled in Key HR’s benefit plans, Key HR prepares and files Forms 1094-C and 1095-C. We work with you to collect the hours and eligibility information the reports require.": "Pou anplwaye ki enskri nan plan avantaj Key HR yo, Key HR prepare epi depoze Fòm 1094-C ak 1095-C. Nou travay avè ou pou rasanble enfòmasyon sou èdtan ak kalifikasyon rapò yo mande.",
"Do I still need my own attorney or CPA?": "Èske mwen toujou bezwen pwòp avoka oswa CPA mwen?",
"Yes, for matters outside the PEO relationship, such as legal representation, business income tax and other types of insurance. Key HR works alongside your advisors and keeps them informed when it helps.": "Wi, pou zafè ki an deyò relasyon PEO a, tankou reprezantasyon legal, taks sou revni biznis ak lòt kalite asirans. Key HR travay kòt a kòt ak konseye ou yo epi li kenbe yo enfòme lè sa itil.",
"Compliance is one part of a complete solution. Key HR also provides payroll, HR, risk management and employee benefits, all managed by one accountable team.": "Konfòmite se yon pati nan yon solisyon konplè. Key HR bay pewòl, RH, jesyon risk ak avantaj pou anplwaye tou, tout jere pa yon sèl ekip ki responsab.",
"This page is provided for general information only and is not legal or tax advice. Requirements vary by state and change over time.": "Paj sa a la pou enfòmasyon jeneral sèlman, li pa yon konsèy legal oswa fiskal. Egzijans yo varye dapre eta epi yo chanje avèk tan.",
"Stay Compliant as You Grow": "Rete an konfòmite pandan w ap grandi",
"Tell us where your employees work and where you plan to hire next. A Key HR specialist will show you exactly which obligations we take on and how we support the rest.": "Di nou ki kote anplwaye ou yo travay ak ki kote ou planifye pou anboche pwochènman. Yon espesyalis Key HR ap montre ou egzakteman ki obligasyon nou pran an chaj ak kijan nou sipòte rès la.",
