"Key HR vs. Other PEOs: Why White-Glove, Boots-on-the-Ground Partnership Puts Key HR in a League of Its Own": "Key HR kont lòt PEO yo: poukisa yon patenarya premye klas, ak prezans sou teren, mete Key HR nan yon kategori apa",
"Today’s largest PEOs offer impressive scale and software, but many route business owners through call centers, ticket queues and self-service portals. This article compares Key HR with 15 national PEOs across six hands-on differentiators, and shows how on-site implementations, in-person HR support and boots-on-the-ground risk assessments set a higher standard for growing businesses.": "Pi gwo PEO jodi a yo ofri yon gwo echèl ak lojisyèl enpresyonan, men anpil ladan yo voye pwopriyetè biznis yo nan sant apèl, liy tikè ak pòtay oto-sèvis. Atik sa a konpare Key HR ak 15 PEO nasyonal sou sis diferans pratik, epi li montre kijan enplantasyon sou plas, sipò RH an pèsòn ak evalyasyon risk sou teren mete yon estanda pi wo pou biznis k ap grandi.",
"Read the full article": "Li tout atik la",
"Inside the comparison": "Anndan konparezon an",
"Six differentiators, 16 PEOs": "Sis diferans, 16 PEO",
"Dedicated service model": "Modèl sèvis dedye",
"ESAC accreditation": "Akreditasyon ESAC",
"On-site HR support": "Sipò RH sou plas",
"On-site training": "Fòmasyon sou plas",
"OSHA-certified training": "Fòmasyon sètifye OSHA",
"Dedicated hiring resource": "Resous anbochaj dedye",
"Discover how Key HR’s white-glove customer service, on-site implementations and boots-on-the-ground risk assessments set a higher standard for growing businesses.": "Dekouvri kijan sèvis kliyan premye klas Key HR, enplantasyon sou plas ak evalyasyon risk sou teren li yo mete yon estanda pi wo pou biznis k ap grandi.",
"Choosing the right Professional Employer Organization (PEO) is one of the most consequential operational decisions a growing business can make. Today’s PEO landscape offers impressive scale, advanced software platforms and broad national footprints. Yet as the largest providers expand to serve hundreds of thousands of worksite employees, business owners increasingly face a critical choice: do you want a system with limited customer service, or a dedicated, white-glove partner that shows up in person to protect and grow your business?": "Chwazi bon òganizasyon patwon pwofesyonèl (PEO) a se youn nan desizyon operasyonèl ki pi enpòtan yon biznis k ap grandi ka pran. Jodi a, mache PEO yo ofri yon echèl enpresyonan, platfòm lojisyèl avanse ak yon prezans nasyonal laj. Men, pandan pi gwo founisè yo ap elaji pou sèvi plizyè santèn milye anplwaye, pwopriyetè biznis yo plis e plis devan yon chwa enpòtan: èske ou vle yon sistèm ki gen yon sèvis kliyan limite, oswa yon patnè dedye, premye klas, ki vin an pèsòn pou pwoteje biznis ou epi fè l grandi?",
"While each PEO brings some strengths to the table, Key HR’s white-glove customer service and hands-on approach to client care place us in a league of our own.": "Byenke chak PEO gen kèk pwen fò, sèvis kliyan premye klas Key HR ak fason nou okipe kliyan nou yo de pre mete nou nan yon kategori apa.",
"Understanding our competitors in the industry": "Konprann konkiran nou yo nan endistri a",
"Before examining what makes Key HR’s service model unique, it is worth recognizing that many other PEOs exist, each suited to different business profiles.": "Anvan nou gade sa ki fè modèl sèvis Key HR la inik, li bon pou nou rekonèt gen anpil lòt PEO ki egziste, e chak youn ladan yo fèt pou kalite biznis diferan.",
"When comparing Key HR to other providers, one core feature that sets us apart is our dedicated service model. Most PEOs rely heavily on centralized call centers, ticket queues and self-service portals, and business owners often find themselves navigating complex HR or safety challenges from behind a screen rather than alongside a trusted advisor.": "Lè ou konpare Key HR ak lòt founisè, youn nan karakteristik prensipal ki mete nou apa se modèl sèvis dedye nou an. Pifò PEO depann anpil sou sant apèl santralize, liy tikè ak pòtay oto-sèvis, e pwopriyetè biznis yo souvan oblije jere defi RH oswa sekirite ki konplike dèyè yon ekran, olye yo fè sa ansanm ak yon konseye yo fè konfyans.",
"The comparison below highlights how Key HR stacks up against the top 15 national PEOs across six high-touch, operational differentiators: a dedicated service model, ESAC accreditation, on-site HR, on-site training, OSHA-certified training and dedicated hiring resources.": "Konparezon ki anba a montre kijan Key HR konpare ak 15 pi gwo PEO nasyonal yo sou sis diferans operasyonèl ki mande yon kontak pèsonèl: yon modèl sèvis dedye, akreditasyon ESAC, RH sou plas, fòmasyon sou plas, fòmasyon sètifye OSHA ak resous anbochaj dedye.",
